<title>BELGIUM: EU clears BT/MCI deal.</title>
<headline>EU clears BT/MCI deal.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission Wednesday cleared the merger of Britain's British Telecommunications and U.S. telecoms giant MCI Communications Corp. after the companies made certain concessions, the commission said.</p>
</text>
